From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:34:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] iOS shell: link the host into each game's framework so engine
 updates keep installed games playable

Add the DmShellGame target in project-framework.yml and dm/ios/framework/ShellGlue.m so build_ipa.sh DM_FRAMEWORK_ONLY builds each shell game's DmGame<title ID>.framework with its own host, shader chain and compiled game_profile.h (manifest loader FH), compiling Sources/GameMenu.swift and Sources/LauncherSettings.swift directly into DmShellGame. Trim DmShell in project-shell.yml, build_shell.sh and ShellMain.m to a thin launcher that dlopens the chosen game's framework and enters its host through dm_glue_start_game, dm_glue_present_game and dm_glue_focus_event.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Each shell framework links its own host so engine updates never invalidate installed games
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#451
